<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Pet Grooming</title>
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</head>
<body>

<!-- Navigation Bar -->
<nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg bg-body-tertiary">
  <div class="container-fluid">
    <a class="navbar-brand" href="#">Pet Grooming</a>
    <div class="collapse navbar-collapse">
      <ul class="navbar-nav ms-auto">
        <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link active" href="/grooming">Home</a></li>
        <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/appointment_grooming">Book</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- Hero Section -->
<div class="container text-center mt-4">
  <img src="https://placekitten.com/800/300" alt="Grooming Pets" class="img-fluid rounded">
  <h1 class="display-4 mt-3">Welcome to Pet Council Grooming Centre</h1>
</div>

<!-- Introduction -->
<div class="container my-5">
  <h2>Introduction</h2>
  <p>At Pet Council, we believe every pet deserves to look and feel their best. Our team offers grooming services tailored for your furry friends in a stress-free and safe environment.</p>
</div>

<!-- Why Choose Us -->
<div class="container my-5">
  <h2>Why Choose Our Pet Grooming Services?</h2>
  <p>We use gentle techniques, premium products, and give your pets the care they deserve. Our groomers are passionate, professional, and experienced in handling all breeds.</p>
</div>

<!-- Services Provided -->
<div class="container my-5">
  <h2>Grooming Services Provided</h2>
  <p>Our offerings include full grooming, nail trimming, de-shedding, ear cleaning, styling, and more. We cater to the unique grooming needs of each pet based on breed and lifestyle.</p>
</div>

<!-- Grooming Menu -->
<div class="container my-5 text-center">
  <h2>Pet Grooming Menu</h2>
  <img src="https://placekitten.com/600/200" alt="Grooming Menu" class="img-fluid rounded mb-3">
  <table class="table table-bordered table-striped">
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Service</th><th>Price</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>Basic Wash & Dry</td><td>$25</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Full Groom (Small Dog)</td><td>$45</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Full Groom (Large Dog)</td><td>$60</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Tick & Flea Treatment</td><td>$35</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>

<!-- Safety Section -->
<div class="container my-5">
  <h2>Pet Safety</h2>
  <p>Your pet's safety is our #1 priority. All tools are sanitized after each use, and we use only vet-approved, skin-safe grooming products.</p>
</div>

<!-- Book Appointment -->
<div class="container my-5 text-center">
  <h2>Book Your Appointment Today!</h2>
  <img src="https://placekitten.com/600/250" class="img-fluid rounded mb-3" alt="Book Grooming">
  <p>Get your pet the grooming they deserve. Fast, friendly, and affordable service awaits you.</p>
  <a href="/appointment_grooming" class="btn btn-primary">Go to Appointment Form</a>
</div>

<!-- Footer -->
<footer class="bg-dark text-white text-center py-3 mt-5">
  <p>&copy; 2025 Pet Council. All rights reserved.</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
